LITERAL_ECEA_CF38_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_ECEA_CF38_CORRECT_1';
<strong><span style='font-family: monospace;'>SPARED</span></strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp; <i>gene order of S, P, A, R, E, and D</i>
LITERAL_ECEA_CF38_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
